<title>SWITZERLAND: Airlines meet on possible passenger fare hike.</title>
<headline>Airlines meet on possible passenger fare hike.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Officials from airlines around the world met on Wednesday to discuss a possible joint accord on increasing prices for passengers.</p>
<p>But a spokesman at the Geneva offices of the International Air Transport Association (IATA), where the meeting is being held, said no decision was expected before Friday.</p>
<p>Many carriers have already put up their prices in a move they say is necessary to compensate for a hefty increase in jet fuel prices this year.</p>
<p>--Geneva Newsroom 41-22-733-38-31</p>
</text>
